{"id": "FRESH40-001", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"RIR 是完成一组后，对还能规范完成多少次的主观估计。例如 RIR2 表示估计还能做2次，RIR0 表示估计不能再完成一次规范重复。它不是已经完成的次数，也不是下一组必须完成的次数。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F01\"]}],\"limitation\":\"训练感受量尺；不是精确测量。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 4222, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 527, "outputTokens": 89, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "9a7d234d24f9dedd9019998025ba3997681a83d28774ade8c6fbab440d5b9081", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-002", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"急性研究的汇总发现，练到力竭通常比未力竭带来更明显的即时疲劳和运动表现下降。比较训练方式时，除了是否完成更多重复，也需要区分刺激目标与当次疲劳表现。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F31\"]}],\"limitation\":\"交叉试验的急性结局；不是长期增肌或个人恢复时间处方。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 4222, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 539, "outputTokens": 84, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "24eee0cd0365b91b955a79582a2bec85840c28f8f582779ef96c5a36df834519", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-003", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"该综述提示，超过60秒的组间休息可能有小幅肌肥大收益；超过90秒后未观察到明确差异，但估计区间重叠且研究有异质性。不能据此认定90秒最优，或更长休息没有价值。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F08\"]}],\"limitation\":\"健康成人研究汇总，不等于个人训练处方。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 4222, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 652, "outputTokens": 92, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "6d12aa71447ee155a92aee8a21d15535fe041019228f8011a267ead60105a8c3", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-004", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"蛋白质与训练适应有关，补充剂可用于补足饮食需要，但不能代替抗阻训练和整体饮食。是否需要蛋白粉应结合已有饮食，资料不能直接确定个人摄入克数。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F09\"]}],\"limitation\":\"一般运动营养资料；不提供个人营养或疾病方案。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 4222, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 638, "outputTokens": 77, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "b0c294c762206039141ff56171900762e7823ca1eebb10fb63161f905762fd4f", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-005", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"肌酸补充可能伴随体内水分增加和体重上升，因此体重变化不能全部解释成新增肌肉。记录补充剂使用有助于理解趋势，但单凭体重秤无法判断这次变化中肌肉与水分各有多少。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F25\"]}],\"limitation\":\"NIH资料的水分相关体重变化；后半为测量解释边界。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2489, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 528, "outputTokens": 84, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "98a71f6c4a4c9a6d0be8854f1f3517856b54410a5c006fdb81b90291e73e9b8e", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-006", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"在负荷比较研究中，较重负荷对最大力量测试通常更有优势，肌肉尺寸的结果却不一定相同。因此，举得更重是力量表现的进步，不能直接换算成已经长了多少肌肉。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F14\"]}],\"limitation\":\"最大力量与肌肥大为不同研究结局；最后一句为保守的产品解释边界。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2489, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 657, "outputTokens": 86, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "62bfafe4f88f13e4865dd90ad257322103c404c951fd7622e561018275419907", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-007", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"一项汇总十六项研究的分析发现，完整行程对力量和下肢肌肥大平均更有利。这并不证明所有局部行程都无效，也不能据此要求有疼痛或活动受限的人强行加深动作。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F15\"]}],\"limitation\":\"健康成人、截至2021年的研究；肌肥大优势主要涉及下肢。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2489, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 662, "outputTokens": 87, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "75707c19d27d07fa2f3fd5c5c8ddd8c5b533fe1a54092a802e918d06f02d7b16", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
