{"id": "FRESH40-010", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"一项离心运动实验发现，酸痛程度与其他肌肉损伤指标的相关性较弱。因此，感觉越酸不能直接解释为肌肉受损越多，更不能进一步当作这次一定长了更多肌肉的证明。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F27\"]}],\"limitation\":\"男性学生的肘屈肌最大离心实验；最后一句为不作过度推断的边界。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2719, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 644, "outputTokens": 88, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "9fe8f90959ef2d040af1ad0e272c8a115532c1b1392e65b80c97e109bbaff395", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-011", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"一项有训练经验成人的下肢实验发现，在八周周期内，逐步加重量与逐步加重复次数都可带来肌肉适应。没有每次加片不等于没有进步，但不能把次数增加直接换算成肌肉增长量。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F33\"]}],\"limitation\":\"特定监督训练方案、成年训练者；不能承诺所有进阶方式永久等效。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2719, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 678, "outputTokens": 94, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "40136de762deb25accdf8687a52e230a376c7e36bc509829864be7934bc65b6b", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
