{"id": "FRESH40-016", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"节奏研究会区分举起重量的向心阶段与放下重量的离心阶段。只写慢速或快一些，无法说明到底改了哪一段；比较训练记录时，应保留这种差别，不把整组耗时直接当成增肌量。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F39\"]}],\"limitation\":\"研究变量定义及记录解释，不提供每阶段的个人秒数处方。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2799, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 676, "outputTokens": 95, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "6f3bf90c52fb7d449b4289ce913a1d9dbd17b33b590881b9f6c35bfb5c2b1500", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-017", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"动作顺序综述发现，放在训练前面的动作通常获得更大的对应力量提升。优先顺序可以服务具体力量目标，不能因此机械规定所有人都必须先练大肌群，或永远先做复合动作。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F40\"]}],\"limitation\":\"纵向研究的动作特定力量结果；不覆盖每种训练目标。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2682, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 663, "outputTokens": 80, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "2c5c52de05d0d6a78057ac28cbfe305f4b76a4029d97c52a5e9826151b905c13", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-018", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"长期吃不够可能限制增肌适应\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F42\"]}],\"limitation\":\"至少三周的研究；瘦体重不是直接测得的纯肌肉，不设个人热量阈值。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2682, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 678, "outputTokens": 52, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "d03d3bb4da42e96f54acb31378d6eebd3a5e29aaf3db08826123e8c3c3b9877b", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-019", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"一项训练者的小型实验中，体重增长更快主要与皮褶厚度增加相关，肌厚和力量并未普遍同步获益。瘦人增肌也不能把体重快速上涨当作唯一目标，更不能把全部增重都算成肌肉。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F43\"]}],\"limitation\":\"八周、十七名完成人的小型试验；不是通用增重速度上限。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2682, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 565, "outputTokens": 92, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "9b2a3208b773d138f0c98c1cb945acb3a824ddf333f7538de8d5f9323c9d4b36", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-020", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"同一碳水综述中，观察到表现收益的研究较常涉及空腹对照或较高训练量。回答训练前要不要补充时，应先区分进食和训练条件，而不是把一种场景的结论套给所有健身者。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F45\"]}],\"limitation\":\"条件性、异质性研究发现；不指定进食时间、克数或训练量个人阈值。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2682, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 659, "outputTokens": 95, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "32da6f94d918af939d6b75596d01ffdb34e3a764d647bafb950638bad9e0c895", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-021", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"常见脚底电极智能秤会结合阻抗、身高、体重、年龄等信息估计身体成分，并不是直接称出身体里的肌肉。估计依赖公式与人群数据，因此不能把显示的小数精度当成真实测量精度。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F47\"]}],\"limitation\":\"研究描述的脚到脚阻抗设备原理；不是对所有测量技术的统一结论。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2856, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 681, "outputTokens": 92, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "cfca3b18553c32386c24dd3f965cb4ae37c3d6102b0b6aee478dc650f704d850", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-022", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"一项急性测量实验发现，饮水后某些阻抗设备会把增加的质量部分归为脂肪，体脂率读数随之变化。短时间读数跳动不等于真正迅速长脂肪，比较趋势时需要注意测量条件。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F48\"]}],\"limitation\":\"特定设备与一次饮水实验；不建议模仿实验饮水量，也不提供校准公式。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2856, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 665, "outputTokens": 91, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "56a9f4c1c293d99c0de0d9e0b03bd8b442a57f917f0d1b22bb5611a609d64d47", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-023", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"在动作行程匹配的八周实验中，有训练经验者使用哑铃或绳索侧平举，三角肌中束肌厚都增加，差异支持相近效果。不能只因绳索阻力感觉不同，就断言它对所有人一定更增肌。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F49\"]}],\"limitation\":\"二十四名训练者、特定行程与方案；不能推广为所有器械和动作完全等价。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2856, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 656, "outputTokens": 101, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "d7822e93709eaf34d743ee41feaea65fd603122746f19bf4a19658a8aee8afaa", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-024", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"未训练年轻男性的实验中，上斜、平板及组合卧推在一般力量变化上相近，但胸肌某个测量位置的增长不同。一个区域有差异，不能直接解释成整个胸肌都更大或某个角度全面更好。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F50\"]}],\"limitation\":\"八周、每周一次、三处肌厚测量；不能据此给所有人规定卧推角度。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2856, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 682, "outputTokens": 95, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "dbe61b937658c40c0dbaca5ea37f1382a0a17bc4382d582288010eef1f149b92", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-025", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"健康成人的十二周实验中，坐姿腿弯举对部分跨髋又跨膝的腘绳肌增长更有利，俯卧姿势也有增长。不能把这个结果简化成所有长肌长动作都必胜，或认为另一种姿势完全没用。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F51\"]}],\"limitation\":\"二十名成人的单腿对照、特定动作；肌肉之间的结果并不一致。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2658, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 690, "outputTokens": 95, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "ef4dfc92dda0646ff049d5a304bbefa2ec320b2aeaaa14efb026d638a8ff4336", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
{"id": "FRESH40-026", "output": "{\"status\":\"answered\",\"points\":[{\"text\":\"一项深蹲实验中，膝伸肌、臀大肌和内收肌出现不同程度的增长，而腘绳肌和股直肌没有同样变化。动作属于腿部训练，不代表腿部每一块肌肉获得了相同的增长效果。\",\"sourceIds\":[\"F52\"]}],\"limitation\":\"十七名男性、十周、特定深蹲方案；未显著增长不等于完全没有参与。\"}", "batchElapsedMs": 2658, "batchSize": 4, "inputTokens": 690, "outputTokens": 90, "limited": false, "model": "C:\\Users\\liumu\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-11-13\\wo-x\\outputs\\LiftLog-Atlas-1.7B-Run01\\model", "adapterSha256": null, "promptSha256": "988fb0150e32768722b0390756adc869838fe3c263bfca8c0d681a24af6e3529", "datasetSha256": "221cfe05eee1a0dccfee7ca1638d93187a9c5f06313a0cb78a866d1f6d8938ec", "decoding": {"thinking": false, "sample": false, "seed": 42, "maxNewTokens": 512}}
